        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="300149602080480" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#D9A400;dashed=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14.5;fontColor=#16191F;fontFamily=Helvetica;arcSize=4;spacing=8;" value="The Auto Scaling Group continues to launch new instances from the Base AMI via the Launch Template. Application versions are managed independently through the container image and this deployment process — no new AMI is required per release." vertex="1">
